<section class="da-section da-section--faq" aria-labelledby="deletion-faq-title">
  <div class="da-shell da-faq">
    <header>
      <p class="da-overline">Questions</p>
      <h2 id="deletion-faq-title">Account deletion help</h2>
    </header>
    <div>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I request deletion without the app?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Use the web request form above or email <a href="mailto:privacy@chakusarecovery.com">privacy@chakusarecovery.com</a>. You do not need to install or reinstall Chakusa.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can someone delete my account with only my email address?</summary>
        <p>No. The authenticated app flow requires fresh confirmation. A web request requires ownership verification before deletion is processed.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if I own a business with active team members?</summary>
        <p>The direct deletion flow will not delete the owner while other active team members remain. Transfer ownership if the business should continue, or remove the other members if the business should be deleted with your account.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does deletion cancel my subscription?</summary>
        <p>No. Cancel subscriptions billed by Apple or Google in the applicable store account settings.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Where can I read Chakusa's privacy information?</summary>
        <p>Read the current <a href="/privacy">Chakusa Privacy Policy</a>. For a question about your data, email <a href="mailto:privacy@chakusarecovery.com">privacy@chakusarecovery.com</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
